10. LLAMA.CPP SETUP

ISHA currently uses a llama.cpp/GGUF architecture.

The installer must automatically install/download the correct llama.cpp runtime.

Detect hardware where possible:

CPU
Vulkan
CUDA
AMD/ROCm

Then choose the appropriate supported backend.

Do NOT download every backend.

Only install the backend appropriate for the user's machine, with a safe CPU fallback.

If GPU acceleration is unavailable:

GPU acceleration unavailable.
ISHA will use CPU mode.

Do not treat this as a fatal installation error.

